    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/ehb/voice/ehb-p1-v1/p1/26.wav",
    "tts_text": "みんなは、タダのタクシー、乗る？断る？",
